"name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af676bef4429d1fd72f788d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537150095,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:32:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af676baf4429d1fd72f7880","chatId":"0b5c12c0bef04170886d8d8cdf35d048","sessionId":null,"userId":99852,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"这个问题问得很重要。你聊的内容我会保密，不会主动告诉你爸妈；只有涉及你的人身安全这类很危险的情况，我才会考虑找能帮到你的人。你担心他们会知道，是有什么不想让他们知道的吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"这个问题问得很重要。你聊的内容我会保密，不会主动告诉你爸妈；只有涉及你的人身安全这类很危险的情况，我才会考虑找能帮到你的人。你担心他们会知道，是有什么不想让他们知道的吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2103,"promptTokens":2541,"completionTokens":90,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:32:26"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":13,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006691156619991734,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af676baf4429d1fd72f787f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537146489,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:32:26","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af676baf4429d1fd72f787f","chatId":"0b5c12c0bef04170886d8d8cdf35d048","sessionId":null,"userId":99852,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"就……有点空，还有点烦自己。明知道该干点正事，又什么都没干。嗯……对了，我想问一下，我们聊的这些，你会告诉别人吗？比如我爸妈？<第6轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaT